  "notes": "Deliberately 'dumb' self-hosted budget app: everything in one centered white sheet with a soft shadow on grey. Material-ish colours (#2196f3 blue, #f44336 red, #4caf50 green). Income/Expenses tiles have a 4px coloured left border (green/red) and a tiny funnel icon that toggles a type filter (active state turns green with a circular tint). Recurring transactions get a blue left border, a ↻ glyph and a faint '(Recurring)' text tag. Amounts right-aligned, red for negatives, green for income, each row with a light-red trash icon. Sort control is a pill segmented toggle (calendar vs $) with a separate arrow for direction. Add Transaction opens a modal (not in capture) with Income/Expense segmented toggle, amount/description/notes/date fields and a Recurring checkbox. Footer exports CSV/PDF. Moon icon toggles dark theme."
